# FACILITY-07 — night shift floor plan. One character is one 1m x 1m cell.
#
#   '#' wall        '+' door          '=' sealed door (behaves as wall until unsealed)
#   '*' terminal    letters/'%'       room interiors, declared by the 'room' lines below
#
# room <glyph> <code> <ROOM|CORRIDOR|HIDDEN> <label...>
# camera <code> <room glyph> <mount corner NW|NE|SW|SE> [hidden]

room A ROOM-01 ROOM SECURITY OFFICE
room H ROOM-02 ROOM BREAK ROOM
room C ROOM-03 ROOM SERVER HALL
room B ROOM-04 ROOM TAPE ARCHIVE
room D ROOM-05 ROOM RECORDS
room E ROOM-06 ROOM GENERATOR
room F ROOM-07 ROOM LAB A
room G ROOM-08 ROOM LAB B
room I ROOM-09 ROOM DORMITORY
room J ROOM-10 ROOM INFIRMARY
room K ROOM-11 ROOM STORAGE
room L ROOM-12 ROOM LOADING BAY
room n CORRIDOR-N CORRIDOR NORTH CORRIDOR
room s CORRIDOR-S CORRIDOR SOUTH CORRIDOR
room v SHAFT-C CORRIDOR SERVICE SHAFT
room % ROOM-00 HIDDEN UNLISTED

camera CAM-01 n NW
camera CAM-02 C NE
camera CAM-03 B NW
camera CAM-04 H SE
camera CAM-05 F NE
camera CAM-06 I NW
camera CAM-07 s SE
camera CAM-08 L NW
camera CAM-00 % NW hidden

map
